[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8943.67, "timestamp": "02:29:03", "text": "应该这样做。让我们来谈谈……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8945.11, "timestamp": "02:29:05", "text": "是的。有人看过吗？有人看过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8950.07, "timestamp": "02:29:10", "text": "外星人舞台？是的。是的。而且我已经……我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8951.75, "timestamp": "02:29:11", "text": "几乎患上了抑郁症。我太喜欢它了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8954.87, "timestamp": "02:29:14", "text": "很多。我还没看过最新一季。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8957.27, "timestamp": "02:29:17", "text": "视频里发生了什么，所以我不知道发生了什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8961.51, "timestamp": "02:29:21", "text": "但我看过一些相关片段，天哪，我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8963.51, "timestamp": "02:29:23", "text": "我知道我当时是，但我看了那些片段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8965.11, "timestamp": "02:29:25", "text": "在我看到那个之前，我就想，别这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8968.95, "timestamp": "02:29:28", "text": "毁了它，我发烧了，一切都变了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8970.67, "timestamp": "02:29:30", "text": "我当时就想，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8975.349, "timestamp": "02:29:35", "text": "2023年JJK阶段会怎么样呢？我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8977.99, "timestamp": "02:29:37", "text": "天哪，我这几年真是太幸福了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8979.79, "timestamp": "02:29:39", "text": "JJK"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8982.309, "timestamp": "02:29:42", "text": "阶段、阶段以及所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8983.75, "timestamp": "02:29:43", "text": "所有这些理论"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8986.71, "timestamp": "02:29:46", "text": "小雕像。我当时就想，“我的天哪。”不，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8988.55, "timestamp": "02:29:48", "text": "你知道吗？如果我不知道什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8990.55, "timestamp": "02:29:50", "text": "你的观点就是你问这个问题时所关注的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8994.469, "timestamp": "02:29:54", "text": "我。嗯，我并不真的责怪那些人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8997.27, "timestamp": "02:29:57", "text": "女性，以及为什么？因为呃，我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.11, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "对所有这些事物的看法完全不同。"}]